            "review_title": "Review at Timelapse Lounge",
            "review_text": "Lam T\n9 contributions\n0\nDelicious drink - Nice view - Place to chill\nOct 2019\nI first visited Timelapse last year for a reunion with my friends, and since then, I've kept coming back for more and still haven't had enough of it. \nThey got delicious cocktails and such a fascinating view of the Old Quarter (Hanoi has never looked so immense to me). \nThe atmosphere is cozy and we had our privacy despite being in the same room with other customers (thanks to their lighting design and moderate music volume)\nOverall, I highly recommend this place for dating or hanging out with friend!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 18, 2020",
